{"seq":2,"slug":"iter-range-over-func","title":"iter 迭代器与 Range-Over-Func","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/iter-range-over-func","wordCount":660,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"iter-迭代器与-range-over-func\">iter 迭代器与 Range-Over-Func</h1><p>Go 1.23 引入了实验性的 Range Over Function，Go 1.24 将其正式稳定化并同时将 <code>iter</code> 包升级为 stable API。这一变更从根本上改变了 Go 标准库的遍历范式——从回调式的 <code>Range(func(k,v) bool)</code> 转向可直接用 <code>for range</code> 消费的迭代器函数。对并发编程而言，iter 提供了一种全新的方式来将 channel-based 的流式数据暴露给消费者，同时避免了传统 channel 方案的 goroutine 泄漏风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>iter</code> 包定义了两种迭代器类型签名：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>签名</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>iter.Seq[V]</code></td>\n<td><code>func(yield func(V) bool)</code></td>\n<td>单值序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>iter.Seq2[K, V]</code></td>\n<td><code>func(yield func(K, V) bool)</code></td>\n<td>键值对序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    ITER[&quot;迭代器函数&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;调用 yield(v)&quot;| RANGE[&quot;for range 循环&quot;]&#10;    RANGE --&gt;|&quot;yield 返回 true&quot;| ITER&#10;    RANGE --&gt;|&quot;yield 返回 false (break)&quot;| STOP[&quot;迭代终止&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    ITER[\"迭代器函数\"] --&gt;|\"调用 yield(v)\"| RANGE[\"for range 循环\"]\n    RANGE --&gt;|\"yield 返回 true\"| ITER\n    RANGE --&gt;|\"yield 返回 false (break)\"| STOP[\"迭代终止\"]</pre><p>关键语义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>迭代器是一个<strong>普通函数</strong>，不是 goroutine</li>\n<li><code>yield</code> 的返回值表示消费者是否还想继续：<code>true</code> = 继续，<code>false</code> = 停止</li>\n<li>消费者用 <code>break</code> 退出 <code>for range</code> 时，<code>yield</code> 返回 <code>false</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"基本用法\">基本用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 自定义迭代器：生成偶数序列&#10;func Evens(max int) iter.Seq[int] {&#10;    return func(yield func(int) bool) {&#10;        for i := 0; i &lt;= max; i += 2 {&#10;            if !yield(i) {&#10;                return // 消费者不再需要，提前退出&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 消费&#10;for v := range Evens(20) {&#10;    fmt.Println(v)&#10;    if v &gt;= 10 {&#10;        break // 触发 yield 返回 false&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自定义迭代器：生成偶数序列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Evens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Seq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">yield</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 消费者不再需要，提前退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Evens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 触发 yield 返回 false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"iter-与-channel-的对比\">iter 与 channel 的对比</h2><p>传统 Go 并发中，生产者常通过 goroutine + channel 暴露流式数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 传统方案：需要 goroutine + channel + 关闭管理&#10;func EvensChan(ctx context.Context, max int) &lt;-chan int {&#10;    ch := make(chan int)&#10;    go func() {&#10;        defer close(ch)&#10;        for i := 0; i &lt;= max; i += 2 {&#10;            select {&#10;            case ch &lt;- i:&#10;            case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;                return&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }()&#10;    return ch&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 传统方案：需要 goroutine + channel + 关闭管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EvensChan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        defer</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>channel 方案</th>\n<th>iter 方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>goroutine 开销</td>\n<td>必须启动一个 goroutine</td>\n<td>无 goroutine（同步调用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泄漏风险</td>\n<td>消费者不读完 → goroutine 泄漏</td>\n<td>无泄漏（break 即停）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发安全</td>\n<td>天然跨 goroutine</td>\n<td>单 goroutine 内调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压</td>\n<td>channel 满时自动阻塞</td>\n<td>同步调用，无需背压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>~80ns/次（channel 操作）</td>\n<td>~2ns/次（函数调用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>生产者消费者需并发执行</td>\n<td>遍历集合/生成序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察：<strong>iter 不替代 channel，而是替代「不需要并发但为了遍历而被迫用 channel 的场景」</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与标准库的集成\">与标准库的集成</h2><p>Go 1.24 的 <code>maps</code> 和 <code>slices</code> 包大量使用 iter：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// slices.Collect：将迭代器收集为 slice&#10;evens := slices.Collect(Evens(20))&#10;&#10;// maps.Keys / maps.Values 返回 iter.Seq&#10;m := map[string]int{&quot;a&quot;: 1, &quot;b&quot;: 2, &quot;c&quot;: 3}&#10;for k := range maps.Keys(m) {&#10;    fmt.Println(k)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// slices.SortedFunc + iter 组合&#10;sorted := slices.Sorted(maps.Keys(m))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// slices.Collect：将迭代器收集为 slice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">evens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Collect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Evens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// maps.Keys / maps.Values 返回 iter.Seq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// slices.SortedFunc + iter 组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sorted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发安全的迭代器包装\">并发安全的迭代器包装</h2><p>当底层数据源需要并发访问时，可在迭代器外层加锁：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type SafeStore[K comparable, V any] struct {&#10;    mu   sync.RWMutex&#10;    data map[K]V&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (s *SafeStore[K, V]) All() iter.Seq2[K, V] {&#10;    return func(yield func(K, V) bool) {&#10;        s.mu.RLock()&#10;        defer s.mu.RUnlock()&#10;        for k, v := range s.data {&#10;            if !yield(k, v) {&#10;                return&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SafeStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">K</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> comparable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">V</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RWMutex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SafeStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">All</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Seq2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">yield</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        s.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RLock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.mu.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RUnlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.data {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k, v) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：迭代期间持有 RLock，消费者的 <code>yield</code> 函数中不应尝试获取写锁，否则死锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pull-迭代器-iter-pull\">Pull 迭代器：iter.Pull</h2><p><code>iter.Pull</code> 将 push-style 迭代器转换为 pull-style（手动调用 <code>next()</code>），适用于需要交错消费多个迭代器的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"next, stop := iter.Pull(Evens(100))&#10;defer stop()&#10;&#10;// 手动逐个拉取&#10;v1, ok := next() // 0, true&#10;v2, ok := next() // 2, true&#10;// ...&#10;stop() // 提前终止\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next, stop </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Evens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">defer</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 手动逐个拉取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v1, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0, true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v2, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2, true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 提前终止</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>iter.Pull</code> 内部启动一个 goroutine 来驱动 push 迭代器——因此必须调用 <code>stop()</code> 避免泄漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sync-map-与-iter-的集成-go-1-24\">sync.Map 与 iter 的集成（Go 1.24+）</h2><p><code>sync.Map</code> 的 <code>Range</code> 方法在 Go 1.24 中新增了 iter 友好的使用方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"var m sync.Map&#10;m.Store(&quot;key1&quot;, &quot;value1&quot;)&#10;m.Store(&quot;key2&quot;, &quot;value2&quot;)&#10;&#10;// 传统回调式&#10;m.Range(func(key, value any) bool {&#10;    fmt.Println(key, value)&#10;    return true&#10;})&#10;&#10;// sync/v2 提案中的 All() 将返回 iter.Seq2[K, V]&#10;// （尚未发布，但方向已确定）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"value1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"value2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 传统回调式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// sync/v2 提案中的 All() 将返回 iter.Seq2[K, V]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// （尚未发布，但方向已确定）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>iter.Seq/Seq2 是 Go 1.24 稳定的迭代器协议：<code>func(yield func(V) bool)</code></li>\n<li>相比 channel：无 goroutine 开销、无泄漏风险、性能高 40 倍</li>\n<li>适用于不需要并发的遍历场景；需要跨 goroutine 生产/消费仍用 channel</li>\n<li>iter.Pull 将 push 转 pull，但内部有 goroutine——必须调用 stop()</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"sync-package-evolution\">sync 包演进与泛型化</a>——sync/v2 的泛型 Map.All() 将直接返回 iter.Seq2，iter 与 sync 包的深度集成</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../concurrency-models/other-models-and-significance/data-parallelism-and-coroutines\">并发模型 · 协程与数据并行</a>——iter 的 yield 模式本质是半协程（semicoroutine），与 Python generator、Kotlin sequence 同源</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"iter 迭代器与 Range-Over-Func","id":"iter-迭代器与-range-over-func"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本用法","id":"基本用法"},{"level":2,"text":"iter 与 channel 的对比","id":"iter-与-channel-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"与标准库的集成","id":"与标准库的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"并发安全的迭代器包装","id":"并发安全的迭代器包装"},{"level":2,"text":"Pull 迭代器：iter.Pull","id":"pull-迭代器-iter-pull"},{"level":2,"text":"sync.Map 与 iter 的集成（Go 1.24+）","id":"sync-map-与-iter-的集成-go-1-24"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Goroutine 泄漏防治","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/goroutine-leak-prevention"},"next":{"title":"sync 包演进与泛型化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/sync-package-evolution"}}